    "description": "<p>This dataset contains data collected in the middle of June 2021 with a mobile terrestrial laser scanner (mobile ZEB TLS) in 10 squared areas, of approximatively 20x20m each, in Adamello Brenta National Park. Data have been normalized using TreeLS package in R.</p>\n\n<p>This research was funded with the contribution of the&nbsp;Italian Ministry of Agricultural, Food, and Forestry Policies (MiPAAF)&nbsp;sub-project &ldquo;Precision Forestry&rdquo; (AgriDigit program) (DM 36503.7305.2018 of 20/12/2018).</p>",
